ity his character  temporarily assumed in the comics  regardless of which name he goes by the  screenwriters have promised that Hawkeye  will be a big part of the fourth film  telling BuzzFeed we like Hawkeye we like  Hawkeye so much we gave him a really  good story  Hulk Mark Ruffalo's Bruce Banner had  some performance issues in the third  Avengers movie but at least he made it  out alive after spending a whole movie  and able to summon the Hulk it seems  fair to expect that his powers will be  returned to him at some point in part  four Ruffalo has said that thor ragnarok  and the third and fourth Avengers films  are designed to form one Hulk storyline  over three installments and it's a story  likely to end with a bang Ruffalo was  also spotted on set in a motion capture  suit so either he's still inside that  Hulk buster or the big green guy is  coming back Iron Man if you believe the  rumors and Avengers 4 could be the end  of Tony Stark although Robert Downey jr.  hasn't shared any information and  whether or not his character will make  it through Avengers 4 he has been one of  the more outspoken cast members when it  comes to hyping the film on social media  from all the photos he shared of his  involvement in the movies production we  know for sure that he will appear  whether he makes it out alive well  that's another story  mantas like most of the guardians of the  galaxy from Clemente s Manchester's  integrated at the end of infinity war  the main TF though has already seemingly  confirmed that she'll be back on board  for Avengers for sharing a photo of her  makeup trailer on social media it  doesn't tell us anything about where  she's gone or how she's coming back but  it does show a Lisa Mantis will be  returning for the next Avengers  additionally Chris Pratt revealed in an  Instagram post  he'll be filming guardians of the galaxy  volume 3 will fire in 2019 it seems like  Avengers 4 has no choice but to get  things back on track for the spacefaring